abstract: >-
  Code, pre-registrations, provenance manifests, and evaluation artifacts for
  an HSTU-style pure-PyTorch sequential recommender on the Amazon Reviews 2023
  5-core benchmark: a strictly causal FIR temporal filter (cross-category
  confirmed), a pre-registered per-category point-estimate confirmation on
  Musical_Instruments, a dataset-conditional long-tail pattern with titration
  interventions, a fail-closed artifact-graph build that recomputes every
  printed number from source artifacts, and a shim harness that executes the
  reference comparator implementation locally.
